1gn5|v|To have a share in common with others; to take a part; to partake; -- followed by in, formely by of; as, to participate in a debate. ; To partake of; to share in; to receive a part of. ; To impart, or give, or share of.	s:160z,62,4;1hgk,4,5;agz,4,1;1yhg,1,2~1hgk,4,5;160z,62,4;1yhg,1,2;agz,4,1	d:wr,62,7;tmw,50,7;x5,19,5;1xx3,17,5;psk,6,5;2cj,3,5~tmw,50,7;wr,62,7;psk,6,5;x5,19,5;2cj,3,5;1xx3,17,5	D:wr,54,4;tmw,45,5;xkb,16,5~xkb,16,5;tmw,45,5;wr,54,4
